      <minutesnonemptyhtmlbody>&lt;div class="WordSection1"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;The Combined Authority members
expressed their sincere condolences following the tragic passing of
Leeds councillor, Mahalia France?Mir, this week.&lt;span style=
""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Members spoke warmly of Cllr France?Mir, noting
her wide respect, exceptional dedication and genuine warmth, and
reflected on the profound loss felt by colleagues and residents
alike.&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Members extended their heartfelt
sympathy to her family, friends and all those affected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
