"font:7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;Approved the first year (2026/27) of the indicative
Capital Programme totalling &amp;pound;767m, as set out in section
3.17.01, and noted the indicative onward programme
thereafter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent:-.5in"&gt;&lt;span style=
""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in; text-indent:-.5in"&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;7.&lt;span style=
"font:7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;Noted and had regard to the advice of the Director
of Finance and Commercial Services (Section 73 Officer) regarding
the robustness of the budget and the adequacy of reserves as set
out in sections 4.3 &amp;ndash;4.7 of the submitted report.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent:-.5in"&gt;&lt;span style=
""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in; text-indent:-.5in"&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;8.&lt;span style=
"font:7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;Delegated authority to Combined Authority officers
to progress expenditure within this budget that was in furtherance
of Combined Authority financial regulation and schemes of
delegation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent:-.5in"&gt;&lt;span style=
""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in; text-indent:-.5in"&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;9.&lt;span style=
"font:7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;Noted the current medium?term financial plan, its
risks and uncertainties, particularly those relating to bus
franchising, and endorsed the proposed approach to further
financial planning and mitigations work during the first half of
2026, with an update to be brought to the Combined Authority in
Summer 2026 (section 4.1).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent:-.5in"&gt;&lt;span style=
""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in; text-indent:-.5in"&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;10.&lt;span style=
"font:7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=""&gt;Considered the draft Directorate Plans on a Page and
noted that final draft Plans and the overarching Corporate Plan for
2026/27 would be presented to the March 2026 Combined Authority
meeting for approval.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style=""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
